From: Howard Hsu <howard-yh.hsu@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 6 Dec 2023 08:53:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: support scs feature

Smart Carrier Sense: a 1 Hz worker feeds per-band traffic statistics
to the firmware CCA adaptation algorithm. Only active when WED is
enabled with RX capability (MT7981/MT7986 WED 2.0); inert in builds
that keep WED off.

Signed-off-by: Howard Hsu <howard-yh.hsu@mediatek.com>
